    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli yose",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho a Baisilaeli būja ī Hebuloni ū kūlī Daūdi; aho bashika būng'wīla, “A bise tūlī mīlī na mininga gako gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū īkī ū Saulo walī ntemi wise, alīyo naheene nū mu shikū jenījo hū bebe ūyo wagatongeelaga a mabità ga Baisilaeli ū mu makanza ga kūja kū būlūgū na kūshoka. Nīyo ū SEEBA Mulungu wako walī wakūwīla hape gīkī, ‘Ū bebe hū ūkūbadīīma a banhū bane a Baisilseli, hama ūkūbiza nsugi wabo.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a banamhala bose ba Baisilaeli aho biza ī Hebuloni ū kūlī ntemi Daūdi, ūbeeja būlagane hamò nabo ī Hebuloni kū būtongi wa ng'wa SEEBA; būng'witīīla maguta ū Daūdi kūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli, gīt'ūmo walī wahayīla ū Seeba mu nzīla ya ng'wa Sang'weli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūdima nzengo gwa Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi na a Baisilaeli a bose būja kūgūdumīla ū nzengo gwa Yelusalemu, ū nzengo gwa Yebusi. A Bayebusi abo bikalaga moi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "būng'wīla ū Daūdi gīkī, “Ūtūdūla ū kūshika ū ng'wenūmu!” Alīyo naheene ū Daūdi akīdima ī ng'hambī ya kūpīlīla ī ya mu Sayuni, gūbiza nzengo gwa ng'wa Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūhaya gīkī, “Ose-ose ūyo alabize wa kwandya ū mu kūbabūlaga a Bayebusi, akūbiza ntaale wa mabità ga bashilikale bane.” Yoabu ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Seluya ūtonga ū kūlinha ko; na ng'hana ūwanukūla ū būtaale wa mabità. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Daūdi ūbiza ng'wikaji wamo ū mu ng'hambī ya kūpīlīla; kwandīja henaho yitanwa lina lya, ‘Nzengo gwa ng'wa Daūdi’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mapandī ga nzengo ayo gaalī hihī-hiī henaho ūgazenga chiza, kwandīja ipandī lya Milo, kūshisha kū ndugu īyo yalī īgūpīndīlīgije ū nzengo; ū Yoabu nang'hwe ūlībeegeleja ī lipandī īlo līkasaagīīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi wiseema kongeja kūbiza na būdūla, nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wa Būdūla bose walī hamò nang'hwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bagosha ba mbagashūūla ba ng'wa Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba hū bene abo baalī bataale ū mu bagosha ba mbagashūūla abo walī nabo ū Daūdi; a benaba hamò na a Baisilaeli a bose hū bakabūgunaana ū būtemi, būwinha būdūla bo kwigalīhīja, nose kwīsambaalīla pyī ī sī gīt'ūmo Seeba walī wahayīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a mina aya hū ga bagosha ba mbagashūūla abo walī nabo ū Daūdi: Yoshebashebeti muna Hakimoni; ū ng'wenūyo hū walī ntaale wabo a bataale ba mabità. Lwise lūmò akatūmamīla ichimu lyakwe ūbūlaga banhū magana adatū ng'wikanza līmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma yakwe ū ng'wenūyo walīho Elieza ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Dodo, wa lūdūgū lwa ng'wa Ahohi. Ū ng'wenūyo walī ūmò wabo a bagosha ba makaya gete a badatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī hamò nū Daūdi lūshikū lwene Bafilisiti baalī bibilinga Pasi-damimu kūlwa nguno ya kwilwisha būlūgū, h'ipandī ilebe lyalī na ngūnda gwa būsīga; a bashilikale a bangī būbapeela a Bafilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a boi bīīma nyagosha ū mu ngūnda gwenūyo būgūlang'hana; būbatūla kībi no a Bafilisiti; ū Seeba ūbenhela būtindi būtaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwise lūmò mu makanza ga magesa, bagosha badatū ba mu banhū makūmi adatū abo baalī basanyiwe būja kūlī Daūdi, walī Adulamu ng'wipilinga lya kūpīlīla. Ū mu shikū jenījo ibità lya Bafilisiti lyalī lyatūūla ng'hambī mu sī ya ntubīlo gwa Lefaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Daūdi walī ū ng'wipilinga lyenīlo, a Bafilisiti baalī na ng'hambī yabo ya bashilikale ipandī lya Betelehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla ū Daūdi wiyigwa kūkolwa noota, hūna ūhaya, “Gīt'ūlū ni wigela munhū wa kūnenhela minzī kūfuma ū kū lwinzī ūlo lūlī hihī nū mita gwa Betelehemu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana a bagosha ba mbagashūūla a badatū būbatiinya a Bafilisiti, būja ū kū lwinzī ūlo lwalī hihī na Betelehemu būkadaha a minzī būbg'wenhela ū Daūdi. Alīyo aho genhwa ūlema ū kūgang'wa; ūgiita kū būtongi wa ng'wa Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya, “Ū Mulungu ni anihangījage ū nene ū kūgwīta ū gūlī gīko! Ū nene nagang'we a mininga ga banhū abo baalī beegaga būpanga wabo?” Nguno ū kūgenha a minzī genaya baalī bifunya būpanga wabo gete; na lūūlū ū Daūdi ūlema ū kūgang'wa. Ī yenīyo hū ī milīmo īyo bakīīta a bagosha ba mbagashūūla a badatū benabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa Badatū benabo walī Abishai ng'wanong'wawe wa ng'wa Yoabu. Lwise lūmò akatūmamīla ichimu lyakwe ūbūlaga banhū magana adatū; na lūūlū ūpandīka lūkumo lwawiza, nang'hwe ūkumūka gīt'ūmo baalī a Badatū benabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūkumo lwakwe lūkabeela no kūtinda a Badatū benabo, nīyo ūbiza ntaale wabo; nūūlū īkī walī atabalagwa hamò nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho na Benaya ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Yehoyada muna Kazibeeli; nang'hwe walī ngosha apandile ha sī, akīīta mihayo mitaale. Akababūlaga bashilikale babīlī ba Bamoabu, baalī basanyiwe no-no-no ū mu sī yabo. Na lūshikū lūmò lwa mbeho ng'halī akingīla ng'wichongo yalīmo shimba, ūkībūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akalībūlaga n'idaaji lya kūfuma Misili, lya būlīhu wa fuuti mpungatī na nusu. Ī lidaaji lyenīlo ū mu nkono lyalī n'ichimu lya mpīni ntaale gītī ng'wīsī. Alīyo ū Benaya ūlīsanga alī na ng'home dūhū ū mu nkono. Ūshika ūlītaaja ī lī muna Misili ī lichimu īlo lyalī nalyo ū mu nkono gwalyo, hūna ūlībūlagīla ī lichimu lyalyo lyenīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī milīmo yenīyo aho wīyīīta ū Benaya ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Yehoyada, nang'hwe ū lūkumo lwakwe lūkabiza gīt'ūmo lwalī ū lwa bagosha ba mbagashūūla a Badatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei ū mu bagosha ba makaya pye a bose abo makūmi adatū walī akūjiwe no, alīyo ū mu bagosha ba mbagashūūla a Badatū walī atīmo. Ū Daūdi akantūūla kūbiza ntaale wa bashilikale ba kūnang'hana we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagosha ba mbagashūūla benabo baalī aba: Asaheli ng'wanong'wawe wa ng'wa Yoabu, Elihanani ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Dodo, muna Betelehemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shamoti muna Halodi, Helezi muna Paliti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ila ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Ikeshi, muna Tekoa; Abieza muna Anasosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibekai muna Hushati; Ilai muna Ahohi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mahalai muna Netofa; Heledi ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Bana, muna Netofa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itai ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Libai, muna Gibea ya Benjamini; Benaya muna Pilasoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hulai wa kūfuma kū njonga ja Gaashi; Abieli muna Alibati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azimaveti muna Bahulimu; Eliaba muna Sha-aliboni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bitūnja ba ng'wa Hashemu muna Gizoni, Yonasani ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Shagee muna Halalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahiamu ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Sakaali muna Halalī; Elifali ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Uuli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefeeli muna Makelati, Ahiya muna Poleni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezilo muna Kalimeli, Naalai ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Ezibai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoeli ng'wana wa ng'wawe na Nasani, Mibūha ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Hagili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zeleki muna Amoni, Nahalai muna Beeloti; walī mūūcha wa shilanga sha ng'wa Yoabu ng'wa Seluya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ila muna Isla, Galebu muna Isla; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulia ū Nghītī. Zabadi ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Ahalai ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adina ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Shiza, wa lūganda lwa ng'wa Lubeni, ū ng'wenūyo walī ntaale wa banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Lubeni, hamò na bangī makūmi adatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanani ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Maaka, Yosefati muna Misini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzia muna Ashitela, Shama na Yeieli bitūnja ba ng'wa Hosani muna Aloeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yediale ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Shimulī, Walī na ng'wana wa ng'wawe Yoha muna Tizī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elieli muna Mahavī, Yelibaai na Yoshavia bitūnja ba ng'wa Elinaamu, Isama muna Moabu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elieli, Obedi na Yaasieli muna Mozaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
